[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Horizontal Rule
[/meta]

h1. Horizontal Rule

Tests for Section 19 of the specification.

h3. Three hyphens {#hr-three}
[code om]
---
[/code]
[code html]
<hr>
[/code]

h3. More than three hyphens {#hr-many}
[code om]
----------
[/code]
[code html]
<hr>
[/code]

h3. Between paragraphs {#hr-between-paragraphs}
[code om]
Before.

---

After.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Before.</p>
<hr>
<p>After.</p>
[/code]

h3. Indentation is ignored {#hr-indented}
[code om]
   ---
[/code]
[code html]
<hr>
[/code]

h3. Escaped hyphens are text {#hr-escaped}
[code om]
\---
[/code]
[code html]
<p>---</p>
[/code]

h3. Not allowed in the inline profile {#hr-profile-inline}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
---
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]
